  "content": "\n\n<h2>Простой мод хранилища Тома</h2>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/tom5454/Toms-Storage/master/banner.png\" alt=\"Баннер\"></p>\n<h3>Это версия для Fabric. Если вы ищете версию для Forge/NeoForge: <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/toms-storage\" rel=\"nofollow\">Ссылка на проект</a></h3>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/fabric-api\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/Ol1Tcf8.png\" alt=\"Требуется Fabric API\"></a><br>Для Fabric требуется <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/indium\" rel=\"nofollow\">Indium</a>, если у вас установлен Sodium!<br>Простой мод хранилища в стиле ванильного Minecraft.<br>Особенности:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Терминал хранения и крафта</li>\n<li>Коннектор инвентаря</li>\n<li>Открытый ящик</li>\n<li>Беспроводной терминал</li>\n<li>Фильтрованные коннекторы</li>\n<li>Инвентарная воронка</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Терминалы также работают с конструкциями из Create, если <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/create-contraption-terminals\" rel=\"nofollow\">Create Contraption Terminals</a> установлен.<br><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/911/265/2024-07-08_01.png\" alt=\"Терминалы на поезде\"></p>\n<p>Обзоры мода:</p>\n<p><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/UoIi5q8kyo8?wmode=transparent\" width=\"638\" height=\"358\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span> <span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/RwRKNhZ7uec?wmode=transparent\" width=\"638\" height=\"358\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span> <span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/nW5ElcWiC3c?wmode=transparent\" width=\"638\" height=\"358\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></p>\n<h3>Версии по Minecraft и лоадеру:</h3>\n<p>1.21.4 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/toms-storage/files?version=1.21.4&gameVersionTypeId=6\" rel=\"nofollow\">NeoForge</a>, <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/toms-storage-fabric/files?version=1.21.4&gameVersionTypeId=4\" rel=\"nofollow\">Fabric</a><br>1.21.1 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/toms-storage/files?version=1.21.1&gameVersionTypeId=6\" rel=\"nofollow\">NeoForge</a>, <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/toms-storage-fabric/files?version=1.21.1&gameVersionTypeId=4\" rel=\"nofollow\">Fabric</a><br>1.20.6 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/toms-storage/files?version=1.20.6&gameVersionTypeId=6\" rel=\"nofollow\">NeoForge</a>, <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/toms-storage/files?version=1.20.6&gameVersionTypeId=1\" rel=\"nofollow\">Forge</a>, <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/toms-storage-fabric/files?version=1.20.6&gameVersionTypeId=4\" rel=\"nofollow\">Fabric</a><br>1.20.4 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/toms-storage/files?version=1.20.4&gameVersionTypeId=6\" rel=\"nofollow\">NeoForge</a>, <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/toms-storage/files?version=1.20.4&gameVersionTypeId=1\" rel=\"nofollow\">Forge</a>, <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/toms-storage-fabric/files?version=1.20.4&gameVersionTypeId=4\" rel=\"nofollow\">Fabric</a><br>1.20.2 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/toms-storage/files?version=1.20.2&gameVersionTypeId=6\" rel=\"nofollow\">NeoForge</a>, <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/toms-storage/files?version=1.20.2&gameVersionTypeId=1\" rel=\"nofollow\">Forge</a>, <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/toms-storage-fabric/files?version=1.20.2&gameVersionTypeId=4\" rel=\"nofollow\">Fabric</a><br>1.20.1 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/toms-storage/files?version=1.20.1&gameVersionTypeId=1\" rel=\"nofollow\">Forge</a>, <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/toms-storage-fabric/files?version=1.20.1&gameVersionTypeId=4\" rel=\"nofollow\">Fabric</a><br>1.19.4 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/toms-storage/files?version=1.19.4&gameVersionTypeId=1\" rel=\"nofollow\">Forge</a>, <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/toms-storage-fabric/files?version=1.19.4&gameVersionTypeId=4\" rel=\"nofollow\">Fabric</a><br>1.19.3 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/toms-storage/files?version=1.19.3&gameVersionTypeId=1\" rel=\"nofollow\">Forge</a>, <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/toms-storage-fabric/files?version=1.19.3&gameVersionTypeId=4\" rel=\"nofollow\">Fabric</a><br>1.19.2 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/toms-storage/files?version=1.19.2&gameVersionTypeId=1\" rel=\"nofollow\">Forge</a>, <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/toms-storage-fabric/files?version=1.19.2&gameVersionTypeId=4\" rel=\"nofollow\">Fabric</a><br>1.18.2 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/toms-storage/files?version=1.18.2&gameVersionTypeId=1\" rel=\"nofollow\">Forge</a>, <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/toms-storage-fabric/files?version=1.18.2&gameVersionTypeId=4\" rel=\"nofollow\">Fabric</a><br>1.17.1 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/toms-storage/files?version=1.17.1&gameVersionTypeId=1\" rel=\"nofollow\">Forge</a>, <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/toms-storage-fabric/files?version=1.17.1&gameVersionTypeId=4\" rel=\"nofollow\">Fabric</a><br>1.16.5 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/toms-storage/files?version=1.16.5&gameVersionTypeId=1\" rel=\"nofollow\">Forge</a>, <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/toms-storage-fabric/files?version=1.16.5&gameVersionTypeId=4\" rel=\"nofollow\">Fabric</a><br>1.15.2 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/toms-storage/files?version=1.15.2&gameVersionTypeId=1\" rel=\"nofollow\">Forge</a></p>\n<p><a href=\"